===================================================
    
Case 1: an escaped wildcard matches the same rows under utf8_bin, utf8_de_exp and utf8_fr_exp_ab     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
1     [a!%c]     1     1     1     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
2     [!%bc]     4     4     4     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
3     [ab!%]     5     5     5     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
4     [a!_c]     3     3     3     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
5     [%a!%c]     1,6     1,6     1,6     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
6     [a!%c%]     1     1     1     

===================================================
    
Case 2: an escape character that escapes itself or ends a pattern matches the same rows     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
7     [a!!c]     7     7     7     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
8     [ab!]     8     8     8     

===================================================
    
Case 3: level 2 still tells an accent apart after an escape     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
9     [<U+00C4>!%c]     9     9     9     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
10     [c<U+00F4>t!%]     11     11     11     

===================================================
    
Case 4: an escaped space matches the same rows under utf8_bin, utf8_de_exp and utf8_fr_exp_ab     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
11     [ab! ]     13,14     13,14     13,14     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
12     [ab!  ]     14     14     14     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
13     [ab! %]     13,14     13,14     13,14     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
14     [a! b]     15     15     15     

===================================================
id    pattern    rows_bin    rows_de    rows_fr    
15     [! ab]     16     16     16     

